# Nar Shaddaa, the Jekk'Jekk Tarr and Visquis's stronghold (TSL, 303NAR,
# 304NAR, 305NAR): the Exile into the Jekk'Jekk Tarr (Kreia's Breath
# Control), its patrons fought to Visquis's flight, the Twi'lek attendants
# calmed and sent to safety (LSP twice), down into the vent tunnels' maze to
# the sealed stronghold door; Mira's fight with Hanharr in the pit, the
# kath hounds, the Old Beast Tender's keycard and the ring door, a high
# security door sliced (a pit victim's security spike), the emergency tunnel
# control opening the vent tunnels; the Exile in, to Visquis: no trouble
# sought, the bounty asked after, Visquis spared from his Ubese (LSP);
# Goto's droids take the Exile, Zez-Kai Ell finds Mira, Kreia raises
# Hanharr, Mira back with the companions, and T3-M4 sold into Vogga's
# droid warehouse.
# Starts from the flophouse's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @nar_shaddaa_flophouse data/routes/tsl/nar_shaddaa_tunnels.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Meeting with the Exchange" and "Visquis's Lair"
# (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
exit TO_304NAR@2     # the Jekk'Jekk Tarr (the transition past its door)
module 304nar
talk                 # Visquis's welcome, Kreia's Breath Control
fight 40             # the patrons
to tr_visleaveconv   # Visquis leaves for his stronghold
fight 40
say Calm down, I mean you no harm. Where is Visquis? # (LSP)
say Get to safety. I'll handle your master. # (LSP)
use TwilekAtt
talk
exit TO_305NAR       # the vent tunnels
module 305nar
talk
use HighSecurityDoorInterior # the sealed door: Mira in the pit
talk
talk
fight 40             # Hanharr, then the kath hounds
use MidCorpse@3      # the Old Beast Tender's keycard
use MidCorpse@4      # a pit victim's remains (its loot rolled at the
use DoorRing         # Exile's level: a security spike or not)
fight 40
bash HighSecuritDoor # the Sparring Room's locked door (DC 28, past Mira's
                     # Security without a spike): struck open
say Access all available escape routes.
say Activate emergency escape route and leave.
use 305term          # the emergency tunnel control
talk
talk                 # the alarm; the Exile let in
say I'm not looking for trouble # Visquis (LSP)
say Because you've all put a bounty on my head
say I only just arrived on Nar Shaddaa # (LSP)
say Enough - why did you put a bounty on me?
say Leave him alone! # (LSP)
to 305Precog         # the pit: Visquis, Goto's droids, Mira, Kreia, T3 sold
talk
talk
talk
module 303nar
wait 2s
save nar_shaddaa_t3
